sequenceDiagram
    participant DSPO as Data Science Pipelines<br/>Operator
    participant Init as Init Container<br/>(pipelines-components)
    participant Volume as Shared Volume<br/>/config/managed-pipelines
    participant KFPAPI as KFP API Server
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant EvalHubAPI as EvalHub API<br/>HTTPS
    participant KServe as KServe CRDs<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over DSPO,Init: Flow 1: Managed Pipeline Initialization

    DSPO->>Init: Inject RELATED_IMAGE_* env vars
    Init->>Init: Check RELATED_IMAGE_* presence
    alt RELATED_IMAGE_* present
        Init->>Init: Recompile pipelines from source<br/>with image overrides
    else No overrides
        Init->>Init: Use pre-compiled YAMLs
    end
    Init->>Volume: Copy pipeline YAMLs to<br/>/config/managed-pipelines
    KFPAPI->>Volume: Mount and serve managed pipelines

    Note over K8sAPI,S3: Flow 2: Model Fine-Tuning Pipeline

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note right of Init: dataset_download component
        Init->>HF: Download model/dataset<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN
        HF-->>Init: Model/dataset artifacts
        Init->>S3: Download dataset<br/>Auth: AWS credentials
        S3-->>Init: Dataset artifacts
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note right of Init: train_model component
        Init->>Volume: Write trained model<br/>to workspace PVC
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note right of Init: evaluation component
        Init->>EvalHubAPI: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs<br/>Auth: Bearer token
        EvalHubAPI-->>Init: Job ID
        Init->>EvalHubAPI: GET /api/v1/evaluations/jobs/{id}<br/>Poll results
        EvalHubAPI-->>Init: Evaluation results
    end

    Note over K8sAPI,KServe: Flow 3: Model Deployment via KServe

    rect rgb(255, 240, 245)
        Note right of Init: model_deployment component
        Init->>K8sAPI: Create ServingRuntime CR<br/>Auth: SA Bearer token<br/>TLS: CA verified
        K8sAPI-->>Init: ServingRuntime created
        Init->>K8sAPI: Create InferenceService CR<br/>Auth: SA Bearer token
        K8sAPI-->>Init: InferenceService created
        Init->>K8sAPI: Poll InferenceService readiness<br/>Auth: SA Bearer token
        K8sAPI-->>Init: InferenceService ready
    end

    Note over EvalHubAPI,KServe: Flow 4: EvalHub Evaluation

    rect rgb(245, 240, 255)
        Note right of Init: evalhub_evaluator_kserve
        Init->>K8sAPI: Create ServingRuntime<br/>Auth: SA Bearer token
        Init->>K8sAPI: Create InferenceService<br/>Auth: SA Bearer token
        Init->>EvalHubAPI: Submit eval job<br/>Auth: Bearer token<br/>X-Tenant header
        EvalHubAPI-->>Init: Job submitted
        Init->>EvalHubAPI: Poll for results
        EvalHubAPI-->>Init: Evaluation complete
        Init->>K8sAPI: Cleanup KServe resources
    end
